It reads the open data of Infoclimat (https://www.infoclimat.fr/opendata/), a
French non-profit association, with the personal key of the user. The data
belong to Infoclimat and to the owners of the stations, under the license of
each station (Licence Ouverte / Etalab, CC BY or CC BY-NC); they are free for a
personal, non-commercial use and must credit Infoclimat. This integration is
not affiliated with nor endorsed by Infoclimat. The scope follows the Home
Assistant "Infoclimat" integration of nickdesi (MIT); no code is taken from it.
